	<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-50 [background-image:linear-gradient(to_right,rgba(15,23,42,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:25%_100%] dark:[background-image:linear-gradient(to_right,rgba(255,255,255,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>

	<div class="mx-auto grid min-h-[620px] w-full max-w-[1160px] items-center gap-8 px-8 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:py-10">
		<div class="relative z-10 max-w-xl">
			<p class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-sky-500">
				<span class="h-px w-9 bg-sky-400"></span>
				Desarrollador full-stack
			</p>
			<h1 id="hero-title" class="text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.04em] text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
				Construyo productos web que se sienten <span class="text-sky-400">simples.</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-7 max-w-lg text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 sm:text-xl">
				Hola, soy Douglas. Transformo ideas complejas en experiencias digitales claras, rápidas y pensadas para las personas.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
				<a href="/projects" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-slate-950 px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-white transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 dark:bg-white dark:text-slate-950">
					Ver proyectos
					<span aria-hidden="true">↘</span>
				</a>
				<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/douglas-ge/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-sky-400 hover:text-sky-500 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200">
					LinkedIn
				</a>
